  m_Corporation: HE
  m_BlockIdentifier: 
  m_BlockDisplayName: Hawkeye Dual Rotor Swivel
  m_BlockDescription: 'A swivel with two heads at the top and bottom. They, uh, don''t
    move separately, they''re on the same axle. If one gets stuck, you will smell
    burning rubber.

    (Designed by Rafs!)

    Right click to configure this block.


    This is a BlockMover. Blocks attached to the head of this will have their own
    physics separate from the body they are on, yet still restrained to the same tech.
    Like a multi-tech, but a single tech. ClusterTech.'
